════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ 
  v2 ADDITIONS (already wired into this file):
   • Util.FX.PreBoot(UIMainWindow)  right after the main window is Stylize()d  -> boot-up animation
   • Util.FX.MountHero(CracktroFrame, UITextColor, UISound.Music) in the homepage block -> interactive hero triangle
